• Assist with evaluating and structuring customized financing alternatives for private equity sponsors, institutional investors, and their portfolio companies;
• Gain hands-on transaction experience by playing an integral role on deal teams from the initial pitch through closing;
• Prepare marketing materials and buyer diligence materials for LP-led and GP-led secondary transactions;
